Package: libgtkintl
Version: @DEB_LIBGTKINTL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.gtk.org/
Depends: libintl8
Description: proxy-libintl symbol shim for GTK on iOS
 Maps GTK's bundled proxy-libintl symbol names (g_libintl_*) onto the system
 GNU gettext libintl.8. GTK's dylibs and command-line tools are relinked against
 this shim in place of their unshippable bundled libintl.dylib. The shim reexports
 libintl.8 so real libintl_* symbols still resolve, and provides the full
 proxy-libintl wrapper surface (gettext/dgettext/ngettext/textdomain/...).
